# Integration Guidelines

**Toko-Library Development**:

- Keep functions pure and stateless when possible
- Use the context manager for p5.js integration (use internally stored p5.js instance as it might be v1, v2, or Q5)
- Provide both bound and unbound function versions
- Include comprehensive parameter validation

**Toko-Wrapper Development**:

- Handle canvas lifecycle events properly
- Integrate external libraries cleanly
- Provide clear configuration options
- Include proper cleanup and resource management

**End-User Sketch Development**:

- Use the parameter system for interactive controls (Tweakpane controls)
- Follow the established sketch structure
- Include proper event handling
